RELAXED_BOX 71.8083545262548 71.8125837405849 71.8091175522362

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-104.607665732091)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-104.607665732091)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
